        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.626,
            0.047,
            0.847,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": "Large Numbers Around Us"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.088,
            0.848,
            0.144
          ],
          "content": "The population of Mumbai is more than 1 crore 24 lakhs (we saw this in an earlier table). So, the entire population of Mumbai cannot fit in 1 lakh buses."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.148,
            0.846,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": "？ The RMS Titanic ship carried about 2500 passengers. Can the population of Mumbai fit into 5000 such ships?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.203,
            0.851,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_18_image_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.41,
            0.847,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": "Inspired by this strange question, Roxie wondered, “If I could travel 100 kilometers every day, could I reach the Moon in 10 years?” (The distance between the Earth and the Moon is 3,84,400 km.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.466,
            0.621,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": "How far would she have travelled in a year?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.484,
            0.639,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": "How far would she have travelled in 10 years?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.503,
            0.846,
            0.541
          ],
          "content": "Is it not easier to perform these calculations in stages? You can use this method for all large calculations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.549,
            0.847,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": "？ Find out if you can reach the Sun in a lifetime, if you travel 1000 kilometers every day. (You had written down the distance between the Earth and the Sun in a previous exercise.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.616,
            0.847,
            0.654
          ],
          "content": "？ Make necessary reasonable assumptions and answer the questions below:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.659,
            0.847,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "(a) If a single sheet of paper weighs 5 grams, could you lift one lakh sheets of paper together at the same time?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.701,
            0.847,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": "(b) If 250 babies are born every minute across the world, will a million babies be born in a day?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.745,
            0.848,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": "(c) Can you count 1 million coins in a day? Assume you can count 1 coin every second."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.791,
            0.847,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": "？ Think and create more such fun questions and share them with your class."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.85,
            0.292,
            0.874
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
